To test each field individually one-by-one, you need to change the nesting of the loops in your script. Instead of filling all fields with a payload simultaneously, the script should:

   1. Focus on Field A, fill it with an XSS payload, while filling the other fields with safe, valid placeholder data (so the form doesn't reject the submission for being empty).
   2. Submit and test.
   3. Reset, move to Field B, fill it with an XSS payload, and put safe data everywhere else.

This isolates exactly which input box is vulnerable to injection.
